Hi
the method getTaxesRate of classes/carrier.php has a but, in my case I get in all sites everytime the zero value (in ajax cycles).
you should use the same solution used for the same method in product.php
the function become so:

```
    public function getTaxesRate(Address $address = null)
    {
        if (!$address || !$address->id_country) {
            $address = Address::initialize();
        }
    
        $tax_calculator = $this->getTaxCalculator($address);

        return $tax_calculator->getTotalRate();
    }
```

you have missed this condition:
```
        if (!$address || !$address->id_country) {
            $address = Address::initialize();
        }
```

